{"server":"cn","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_11_beg","groupId":"act49side","stageId":"act49side_11","title":"长生劫","storyCode":"TA-11","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_11_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a28dfb5433491cb6c991671da847e818228959dce6d8ec30fb8a2db9a10ae0e6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"现实与梦境的边界，重岳与望遥遥相对。岁兽惊怒。望举起直刀，宣告岁的演化已达终点。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g8_suilingcoreruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......背逆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们之中的每一个，都打算背逆我到底，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。我们每一个，都不会束手就擒，变成你的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们作为自己活过，这就是我们有别于你的根源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为......人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一个个以人自居，还试图以种种妄念来挑战我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们凭靠假借于我的力量，在渺小的族群中赢得一席之地，却又要卑微地隐藏起自己的爪锋与獠牙，装出一副无害的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就是你所谓的，作为人而活着？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是不懂......你不会懂，只因你从未活过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我同样清楚......你的傲慢从何而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以一眼望穿自太古至终末的所有时间，哪怕你的神识已经在太虚中遨游千万载，你也从未有过一个可以对谈的同族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是在这一片可悲的虚无中，将自己当作了至高无上的神明。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我再清楚不过，那究竟是什么样的感觉。\n直到有一人，为我起了一个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你从来不是谁的命运......无论是这片大地上的人，还是我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你更不会懂，对于一个已经一无所有的人而言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......命运本身，何其无力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......既然你胆敢重复无谋的挑战，那我同样不介意再摧毁一次你的妄想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百二十年前我杀死过你，再杀死你一次，不过易如反掌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你以为我会怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经输惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经输掉了太多宝贵的东西，满盘皆输。"},{"type":"narration","text":"尊严，荣誉，信任，自由，自我。\n还有，至亲之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得一个输无可输的人，真的会害怕什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否还会害怕，再遭受一次如同千年前一样惨痛的失败......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是否会因为害怕，迟疑不前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......笑话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不过是妄想要取代我，占据这副身躯——我又岂会让你如愿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我只要让这副躯体先一步醒来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g8_suilingcoreruins"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨兽伸出那如同山岳般庞大的利爪。\n无数个巨兽在无数个岁陵中，向同一个代理人伸出无数个如同山岳的利爪。\n哪怕这里仍是梦境，只要在所有的梦境之中都抹除这张令人生厌的脸，祂的苏醒就再无任何阻碍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事......"},{"type":"narration","text":"一记重击，蕴含着凶暴无匹的力量切实落在祂的躯体上，这样的力量竟然让祂感觉到熟悉。\n祂意识到自己，在这一瞬间失去了与那庞大躯体的连接。\n究竟是谁，还能对这副身躯造成如此的伤害？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"空间先是震动，而后扭曲、撕裂......\n如同被积蓄了千百年的武之一字，硬生生撕裂开来的梦的边界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......多事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道你会这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也答应过，如若真的到了这一步，我会同你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，我也想带她见你一面，让你知道，你这些年的筹谋......毕竟没有白费。"},{"type":"narration","text":"隔着梦境与现实的界限，望先是看见重岳怀中的造物......\n而后，两人目光相接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你该离开了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......活着回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不会向你保证什么。"},{"type":"narration","text":"二人的距离迅速拉远。\n即便是千百岁的武学宗师，人身毕竟仍是人身。\n穿透现实与梦境的力量迅速消散，但望的耳边仍然响起他熟悉到厌烦的那个人的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g8_suilingcoreruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我会去找你。一直找下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......随你的便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他......他究竟做了什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是无妨，无妨！无论他做了什么，都不过只有一瞬......一瞬！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经不会再来打扰我们了，你那些所有的，可笑的，渺小的......兄弟姐妹，都不会再来打扰我们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是我的梦境，这里此刻只有你和我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为应当把最多的力量用来对付你，可现在看来，你仍旧虚弱，仍旧不堪一击，你只剩最后一把棋子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要消灭你......易如反掌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些诗、律、武......那些烦人的蝼蚁，只要动用为你积攒的力量，就可将那些丑陋的干涉，尽数隔绝于外！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":"avg_npc_2129_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你配不上我的爪，你只配在你倒影的刀下断气......死亡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_2027_wang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i16_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可死亡是你的终局，不是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对，在所有的因果，所有的可能，所有的幻梦之中，你都会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梦境中无数次的重复，已经将你最狂暴的那些想象，悉数蛀蚀、掏空，而你浑然不觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你没有发现吗，此时此刻，你用来困住我的梦境，竟都与我，与我们，息息相关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你已经囿于自己愤恨的冲动和复仇的枷锁之中......你的演化已然到达终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我们，已经超越了你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你的身躯终将留存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我，会取代你的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就凭你那些孤立无援的棋子，和行将消散，甚至难以维持形态的身躯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又怎敢断言......我只有棋子......和这副身躯？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"濒死的代理人用最后的力气举起直刀。\n癫狂的巨兽发出最后的怒鸣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>月斫冷子，日老残枰......</i>\n<i>劫灰吹尽送古今。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
